[en.FOCUS_C12_FORMATION_OF_THE_ROCKBREAKER]
Formation of the Rockbreaker

[en.FOCUS_C12_FORMATION_OF_THE_ROCKBREAKER_desc]
An elite task force will be established to carry out the most arduous and difficult combat missions. Officers and soldiers will be selected layer by layer within the military. Only earth ponies with the strongest will and physique will qualify to enter, and they will be ready at all times to fight for the harmony and prosperity of the rock farm.

[zh.FOCUS_C12_FORMATION_OF_THE_ROCKBREAKER]
“碎岩”特战部队

[zh.FOCUS_C12_FORMATION_OF_THE_ROCKBREAKER_desc]
一支精英部队将会成立以执行最艰苦和困难的战斗任务，军官和士兵都会在军队当中层层选拔，只有拥有最坚强意志和体魄的陆马才有资格进入，并随时准备为采石农场和谐律而战。

